(6) The city's right to inspect the facilities and records of the grantee;
(7) Insurance and indemnification requirements applicable to the grantee;
(8) The obligation of the grantee to maintain complete and accurate books of account and records, and the city's inspection rights with respect thereto;
(9) Provisions to ensure quality workmanship and construction methods;
